  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 187 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E14", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The label for our octreotide acetate product identifies USV Private Limited as the registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1321638 of that plant ended on 2026-04-17 and was classified OAI.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification became known on 2026-07-16, which is 187 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E12", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant also received an OAI classification in 2022 and a Warning Letter in 2017.",
      "cites": ["E11", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 17 days of supply on hand, Corvale General has 26 days, and Corvale Lakeside has 19 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    }
  ]
}
